---
unpack:
    -   source: "/run/initramfs/live/live/filesystem.squashfs"
        sourcefs: "squashfs"
        destination: ""
    ## Supplementary overlay squashfs. Later entries overlay earlier ones onto
    ## the same destination, so live edits packed by overlay-squashfs-pack reach
    ## the INSTALLED system without a full image rebuild. The source lives on the
    ## live root's writable overlayfs (tmpfs under /run), NOT the read-only
    ## medium, so it can be created in-session (the pre-unpackfs
    ## shellprocess@overlay_squashfs_pack step writes it). 'optional: true' means
    ## a missing overlay.squashfs is simply skipped.
    -   source: "/run/overlay-squashfs/overlay.squashfs"
        sourcefs: "squashfs"
        destination: ""
        optional: true
